  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1408.03 Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1408.03 Fees.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 321-A:5, I, the annual registration fee for a carnival or amusement ride shall be as provided in Table 1408.1, which shall include the decal fee authorized by RSA 321-A:4. A fiscal year for the purposes of Table 1408.1 shall begin on July 1 and end on the following June 30 in the year indicated in the table, for example, FY 25 begins on July 1, 2024 and ends on June 30, 2025.\n\n(b) The registration fee shall be paid for each carnival or amusement ride registered.\n\n(c) Each registration shall be valid from January to December of each calendar year.\n\nTable 1408.1 Combined Annual Registration and Decal Fees.\n\nAir Supported Structures Other Carnival Amusement Rides\n\nFY 25 $200.00 FY 25 $275.00\n\nFY 26 $200.00 FY 26 $275.00\n\nFY 27 $210.00 FY 27 $300.00\n\nFY 28 $210.00 FY 28 $300.00\n\nFY 29 $220.00 FY 29 $325.00\n\nFY 30 $220.00 FY 30 $325.00\n\nFY 31 $230.00 FY 31 $350.00\n\nSource. #2229, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2950, eff 1-3-85; ss by #4531, eff 1-1-89; ss by #5940, INTERIM, eff 1-1-95; ss by #5952, eff 1-24-95; amd by #7618, eff 12-28-01; ss by #8045, eff 2-20-04; amd by #8115, eff 7-14-04; ss by #8342, eff 4-28-05; amd by #9576, eff 10-23-09; paras (b) & (c) EXPIRED: 1-2-14 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400); ss by #10507, eff 1-21-14, EXPIRED: 1-21-24\n\nNew. #13984, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-24-24, EXPIRED: 11-20-24\n\nNew. #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
